    {
      "Original": "Select weathers which you do not want to ever see again in any zone.",
      "Translated": "选择你不想在任何区域再看到的天气。",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabBlacklist",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "This setting is not effective for zones that have their weathers overriden in zone-specific settings.",
      "Translated": "此设置对在区域专属设置中覆盖了天气的区域无效。",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabBlacklist",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Random normally occurring non-blacklisted weather will be selected to replace blacklisted one.",
      "Translated": "将随机选择正常出现且未被列入黑名单的天气来替换黑名单中的天气。",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabBlacklist",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If there will be no non-blacklisted weather left to choose from, original weather will be kept.",
      "Translated": "如果没有未被列入黑名单的天气可供选择，将保留原天气。",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabBlacklist",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Normally occurring weathers in current zone are highlighted green.",
      "Translated": "当前区域正常出现的天气以绿色高亮显示。",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabBlacklist",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "To unblacklist specific zone without overriding it's weather, go to zone-specific settings and check \"Weather control\"",
      "Translated": "若要取消特定区域的黑名单而不覆盖其天气，请前往区域专属设置并勾选“天气控制”",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabBlacklist",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
