      "Original": "No override - time controlled by game;\nNormal - time controlled by plugin, normal flow; \nFixed - time is fixed to specified value;\nInfiniDay - instead of night, another day cycle will begin\nInfiniDay reversed - instead of night, day cycle rewinds backward\nInfiniNight/InfiniNight reversed - same as day options",
      "Translated": "不覆盖 - 时间由游戏控制；\n正常 - 时间由插件控制，正常流逝；\n固定 - 时间固定为指定值；\n无限白昼 - 夜晚时开始新的白昼循环\n无限白昼（反向）- 夜晚时白昼循环倒回\n无限黑夜/无限黑夜（反向）- 与白昼选项相同",
      "Context": "Gui.DrawTabGlobal",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
